 "summary": "The family product, the Hom-section and inhomogeneous-term products, and the chart converse for inhomogeneous terms have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and they build on existing API (`ofContMDiff`, `contMDiff_hom_bundle_iff`/`contMDiff_hom_bundle_prod_iff`, `Bundle.Pullback.contMDiff_iff`/`contMDiff_lift`, `equivTangentBundleProd`, `ContinuousLinearMap.prod\u2097`). The closest existing declarations (`ContMDiffAlmostComplexStructure.prod`, `ContMDiffAlmostComplexStructureFamily.ofChart`, `InhomogeneousTerm.ext_tangentHom`) cover a fixed structure, a single endomorphism bundle, or the term subtype, so none of them can replace the new declarations.",
